{"type":"FeatureCollection","municipality_code":"29453","pref":"奈良県","city":"東吉野村","display_comment":"東吉野村には、地域の歴史や暮らしを伝える案内板や石碑があり、それらを手がかりに街歩きを楽しめます。 まずは社寺・石碑・案内板に目を向けると、地域の由緒をたどる手がかりが見つけやすいでしょう。 現地では石碑、地蔵、地域資料館、公民館の由緒板を既存ピンと照らし合わせながら歩くと、見落としがちな地域の物語に出会いやすくなります。 ゆかりの人物では瀧川儀作に注目すると、地域に残る文化や時代背景をさらに深く知るきっかけになります。 「丹生川上神社中社（蟻通神社）」や「丹生川上中社のツルマンリョウ自生地」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","layer_counts":{"public_facilities":3,"scenic_nature_areas":2,"cultural_facilities":8,"tourism_resources":6},"total_features":19,"features":[{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"鷲家集会センター","category":"public","address":"東吉野村大字鷲家95","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"29453","municipality_pref":"奈良県","municipality_name":"東吉野村","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[135.9888888,34.42291524]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"東吉野村役場","category":"public","address":"東吉野村大字小川99","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"29453","municipality_pref":"奈良県","municipality_name":"東吉野村","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[135.968307,34.403541]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"中央公民館","category":"public","address":"東吉野村小川475","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"29453","municipality_pref":"奈良県","municipality_name":"東吉野村","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[135.971823,34.401971]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"scenic_nature_areas","name":"自然公園地域","category":"nature","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"29453","municipality_pref":"奈良県","municipality_name":"東吉野村","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_class":"自然公園地域","source_dataset_code":"A10"},"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[135.9890084861111,34.42094319444447],[135.9891814861111,34.420885944444436],[135.98966586111112,34